{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:12 2026-10-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:12 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:12 2026-10-26 HKT</p><img alt=\"石鼓洲焚化廠發生三級火警。Chloe Wan ＦＢ\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b392d75a1321fa531f75ddf08275d100/2026-10/c_0_5.jpg\"/><p>石鼓洲綜合廢物管理設施第1期，今(26日)日12時43分發生火警，濃煙席捲半空，消防接報到場開喉灌救，至中午1時24分，將火警升為三級火，正出動兩喉兩煙帽隊在場撲救。據悉，焚化廠約900多名員工，坐船離開石鼓洲，暫時沒有傷亡報告。</p><p>消防處下午2時40分仍在滅火，處方呼籲市民受到隨風飄散的煙霧和異味影響，請關閉門窗及保持鎮定。</p><img alt=\"焚化廠冒出濃煙。Threads：goblin_under\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f951557f3310749a6bb544ae443a85ec/2026-10/0007bd4d-bf86-48ec-bffb-4ff01697a9c0.jpg\" title=\"焚化廠冒出濃煙。Threads：goblin_under\"/><p>焚化廠冒出濃煙。Threads：goblin_under</p><p>焚化廠冒出濃煙。Threads：edward.chung_</p><img alt=\"工人坐船疏散。Threads：edward.chung_\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/471993ca6ef5606a03158202df56374e/2026-10/i3.jpg\" title=\"工人坐船疏散。Threads：edward.chung_\"/><p>工人坐船疏散。Threads：edward.chung_</p><img alt=\"消防輪出動撲救。FB：香港交通及突發事故報料區\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d9be3e46f39638911289654b3e989e5/2026-10/862466770_3812224962249762_4627306610186283828_n.jpg\" title=\"消防輪出動撲救。FB：香港交通及突發事故報料區\"/><p>消防輪出動撲救。FB：香港交通及突發事故報料區</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:20:49.513572+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":358,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:12:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:18:27.354097+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:18:27.354097+00:00","content_hash":"11ed6117c914f8a103eb2a605f8c8e6fb732893026fd1adccf6efc8c61466f69","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}